h in-memory write buffer\n| * dba467c15 (origin/feat/implement-daemon-agent-dispatch-integration) wip: add WriteBuffer class and unit/integration tests for batch isolation\n|/  \n| * 77f5aedd1 (origin/fix/subagent-exit-code-signal) test: strengthen AC-6 item list parity test with real status verification\n|/  \n| * abb96f65c (origin/chore/add-kspec-observations-skill) chore: add rendered kspec-observations skill to agents directory\n|/  \n* a188f8ade (tag: v0.9.1) chore: bump version to 0.9.1 (#602)\n* 1bdeefbdf (tag: v0.9.0) chore: bump version to 0.9.0 (#581)\n* 976b395b0 (origin/feat/session-event-compaction) fix(session): align compact runtime exit-code trait coverage\n* 1fba3add3 (tag: v0.8.0) chore: bump version to 0.8.0 (#572)\n* 6cbf575d8 (origin/feat/port-legacy-claude-skills-to-core) chore: include rendered kspec codex skills\n* c0268b661 (origin/fix/codex-project-doc-fallback-filenames) docs: align codex seeding AC annotations\n* 24ea2c808 (tag: v0.7.0) chore: bump version to 0.7.0 (#561)\n* 4aa83a982 (origin/docs/task-vs-inbox-guidance) docs: refine task vs inbox guidance wording\n* b4897326e (tag: v0.6.0) chore: bump version to 0.6.0 (#550)\n| * 00623b4c5 (origin/kspec-rebase-test, origin/kspec-meta-backup-2026-02-28) Complete @01KJGW1E: Merged in PR #586. Fixed ralph orchestrator memory leaks: event listener cleanup, session iteration map pruning, bounded recentTaskRefs, ACP client session cleanup on close.\n| * 1ce0ca1e6 (origin/feat/task-e2e-daemon-websocket) fix: address Codex review of E2E WebSocket tests\n|/  \n* 19638ad39 (origin/fix/ralph-missing-session-stamp) fix: use settings.local.json instead of settings.json for env injection\n* 4c69054fb (origin/fix/checkpoint-submit-guidance) fix: update tests to expect task submit in quick commands\n*   84dea5244 chore: bootstrap npm ci and guard hook migration (#539)\n|\\  \n| * 8e0ea9027 (origin/chore/bootstrap-and-guard-cleanup) chore: migrate worktree guard to native kspec command\n* |   d9f141afe feat: add local test sharding scripts for faster dev runs (#536)\n|\\ \\  \n| |/  \n|/|   \n| * 743b2481c (origin/feat/test-sharding-scripts) fix: regenerate kspec-agents.md with kspec v0.5.0\n* |   1654527ed fix: add debug logging for malformed hook input in parseHookInput (#535)\n|\\ \\  \n| * | c60003309 (origin/fix/hook-input-debug-logging) fix: align debugLog pattern and improve test hygiene\n| |/  \n* |   dcd288ea1 fix: add runtime validation for unsafe type casts in session log commands (#534)\n|\\ \\  \n| * | 7333b18f7 (origin/fix/session-log-unsafe-casts) fix: use isObject() utility to eliminate inline type guards in summarizeEventData\n| |/  \n* |   f3527be84 refactor: remove dead code in session modules (#533)\n|\\ \\  \n| * | 14e58b97a (origin/refactor/session-dead-code-cleanup) refactor: remove dead code in session modules\n| |/  \n* | cc37a30e8 (origin/refactor/session-naming-consolidation) refactor: consolidate naming inconsistencies in session modules\n* | 619439646 (origin/test/item-set-enum-edge-cases) test: add edge case tests for item set enum validation\n|/  \n* 15c0bb7a4 (origin/refactor/single-pass-task-bucketing) refactor: single-pass task bucketing in gatherSessionContext\n* 0b1f310ba (origin/fix/note-limit-3x-multiplier) fix: cap total notes at --limit in gatherSessionContext\n* 67e61f5de (origin/fix/shadow-merge-driver-test) fix(test): use project binary for shadow merge driver test\n* 552107eaf (origin/fix/named-stdin-handlers) fix: use named handlers instead of removeAllListeners() for stdin cleanup\n* a5f0304e9 (origin/refactor/extract-session-test-helpers) refactor(test): extract shared test helpers for session start tests (#525)\n* 3ea4616fd (origin/fix/no-op-conditional-assertions) fix(test): remove no-op conditional assertions in session-start-format\n* f461447c5 (origin/refactor/session-split-modules) refactor: split session.ts into focused modules\n* e28c946ef (tag: v0.5.0) chore: bump version to 0.5.0 (#522)\n* eeac88d92 (tag: v0.