.kspec/sessions/01KK0AAVJFNGA9QNWE2BG8B6N7/events.jsonl:664:{"ts":1772760465875,"seq":663,"type":"session.update","session_id":"01KK0AAVJFNGA9QNWE2BG8B6N7","data":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call_W0Phbh10aJ9XuSGwIG6H6PXd","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"```sh\n40061-  },\n40062-  {\n40063-    \"_ulid\": \"01KJXSVK0M6DHDVPA9J4G9XD1G\",\n40064-    \"slugs\": [\n40065-      \"implement-validation-and-alignment-view\"\n40066-    ],\n40067-    \"title\": \"Implement Validation and Alignment View\",\n40068-    \"type\": \"task\",\n40069:    \"spec_ref\": \"@ui-validation-view\",\n40070-    \"plan_ref\": \"@plan-ui-ux-revamp\",\n40071-    \"status\": \"needs_work\",\n40072-    \"blocked_by\": [],\n40073-    \"depends_on\": [\n40074-      \"@implement-app-shell-and-navigation\"\n40075-    ],\n40076-    \"context\": [],\n40077-    \"priority\": 3,\n--\n40094-        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n40095-        \"content\": \"Implemented Validation and Alignment View at /validate route.\\n\\nApproach:\\n- Added fetchValidation() and fetchAlignment() API functions to api.ts with full TypeScript types mirroring daemon response shapes\\n- Built single-page component with three sections: summary cards (errors/warnings/overall status), alignment stats (spec coverage %, alignment %, orphaned specs, warnings), and issues list grouped by severity (errors > warnings > info)\\n- Issues are aggregated from both validation (schema errors, ref errors, trait cycles, completeness warnings, orphans) and alignment (status mismatches, orphaned specs, stale implementations) APIs\\n- Includes loading skeleton, error banner, empty state, and refresh button\\n- Static mode returns empty/valid defaults (read-only)\\n- Uses Svelte 5 runes exclusively (, , .by)\\n- Follows existing patterns from observations/dashboard pages\\n- Sidebar nav entry already existed at /validate with ShieldCheck icon\\n- All data-testid attributes for future E2E testing\\n\\nFiles changed:\\n- packages/web-ui/src/lib/api.ts — Added validation/alignment types and fetch functions\\n- packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte — Full page implementation\",\n40096-        \"supersedes\": null\n40097-      },\n40098-      {\n40099-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK0154ATGTMJR3XH21SPGTA8\",\n40100-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:16:08.282Z\",\n40101-        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n40102:        \"content\": \"Review findings: MUST-FIX 1) No test covers @ui-validation-view ac-1. The only AC annotations are in implementation files at packages/web-ui/src/lib/api.ts:808 and packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:2, and the branch changes no test files. 2) Spec mismatch in packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:60, 341-357, and 362-431: validItemCount is computed but never rendered, and the alignment section shows Alignment plus orphaned specs and warnings instead of the required AC coverage % and orphaned tasks/specs counts from @ui-validation-view ac-1. 3) Design-token gate failed in packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:235,240,263,314,329,345,383,399,449,455,479,485,509,515,540 because the page uses raw Tailwind colors like bg-red-50, text-yellow-600, bg-emerald-500, and bg-blue-50 instead of design tokens. Regression check passed: npm test and packages/web-ui npm test both exited 0.\",\n40103-        \"supersedes\": null\n40104-      },\n40105-      {\n40106-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK01561NNW942M40GXEP0A7V\",\n40107-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:16:10.037Z\",\n40108-        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n40109:        \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: Review issues: missing AC test coverage; validate view misses required valid item count / AC coverage / orphaned tasks data from @ui-validation-view ac-1; raw Tailwind colors used instead of design tokens.\",\n40110-        \"supersedes\": null\n40111-      },\n40112-      {\n40113-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK038AHY7KCNG2DQZQR9DEWD\",\n40114-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:52:50.110Z\",\n40115-        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n40116:        \"content\": \"Fix cycle 1: Addressed all three MUST-FIX items from review.\\n\\n1. AC test coverage: Added 13 E2E tests (validate.spec.ts) covering summary cards, alignment section, issues list grouped by severity, loading/empty/error states, and navigation. All annotated with // AC: @ui-validation-view ac-1.\\n\\n2. Spec mismatch fixes:\\n   - Replaced 'Overall Status' card with 'Valid Items' card showing actual count (total items minus items with errors)\\n   - Replaced 'Alignment %' with 'AC Coverage %' (computed from missing_test_coverage completeness warnings)\\n   - Replaced 'Alignment Warnings' with 'Orphaned Tasks' (tasks without spec_ref)\\n   - Kept 'Orphaned Specs' (already correct)\\n\\n3. Design token gate:\\n   - Added severity tokens (error/warning/info/success) to design system tokens.css with light/dark mode variants using oklch color space\\n   - Added Tailwind theme extensions for severity tokens in app.css\\n   - Replaced all raw Tailwind colors (bg-red-50, text-yellow-600, bg-emerald-500, bg-blue-50, etc.) with semantic severity tokens\\n\\nAdditional: Added /validate plus other missing routes to daemon SPA fallback routes.\",\n40117-        \"supersedes\": null\n40118-      },\n40119-      {\n40120-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK0AAGNBZ9Z746GRS3V82CN6\",\n40121-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-06T00:56:21.931Z\",\n40122-        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n40123-        \"content\": \"Review findings: MUST-FIX 1) packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:57-71 computes \\\"Valid Items\\\" by subtracting unique schemaErrors.file, refErrors.ref, and traitCycles.traitRef values from totalItemCount. Those identifiers are not equivalent to invalid items, so the summary can miscount valid items; packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/validate.spec.ts:214-245 locks in the same incorrect math by asserting \\\"2 errors => 8 valid items.\\\" 2) packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:82-96 computes \\\"AC Coverage %\\\" as (total items - itemsWithMissingCoverage) / total items and explicitly says it uses totalItems \\\"for simplicity.\\\" That is not acceptance-criteria coverage; it is item-level approximation. packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/validate.spec.ts:283-292 bakes in the same wrong behavior by expecting 90% from 10 total items and 1 uncovered item. 3) packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:283-305 uses raw animate-pulse placeholders instead of the design-system shimmer utility in packages/web-ui/src/lib/ds/animations.css:1-65, so the async loading state misses the required shimmer pattern and reduced-motion gating from the review checklist. Regression check passed: npm test exited 0 at repo root, and packages/web-ui npm test exited 0.\",\n40124-        \"supersedes\": null\n```\n"}}]}}
