,\n40107-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:16:10.037Z\",\n40108-        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n40109:        \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: Review issues: missing AC test coverage; validate view misses required valid item count / AC coverage / orphaned tasks data from @ui-validation-view ac-1; raw Tailwind colors used instead of design tokens.\",\n40110-        \"supersedes\": null\n40111-      },\n40112-      {\n40113-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK038AHY7KCNG2DQZQR9DEWD\",\n40114-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:52:50.110Z\",\n40115-        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n40116:        \"content\": \"Fix cycle 1: Addressed all three MUST-FIX items from review.\\n\\n1. AC test coverage: Added 13 E2E tests (validate.spec.ts) covering summary cards, alignment section, issues list grouped by severity, loading/empty/error states, and navigation. All annotated with // AC: @ui-validation-view ac-1.\\n\\n2. Spec mismatch fixes:\\n   - Replaced 'Overall Status' card with 'Valid Items' card showing actual count (total items minus items with errors)\\n   - Replaced 'Alignment %' with 'AC Coverage %' (computed from missing_test_coverage completeness warnings)\\n   - Replaced 'Alignment Warnings' with 'Orphaned Tasks' (tasks without spec_ref)\\n   - Kept 'Orphaned Specs' (already correct)\\n\\n3. Design token gate:\\n   - Added severity tokens (error/warning/info/success) to design system tokens.css with light/dark mode variants using oklch color space\\n   - Added Tailwind theme extensions for severity tokens in app.css\\n   - Replaced all raw Tailwind colors (bg-red-50, text-yellow-600, bg-emerald-500, bg-blue-50, etc.) with semantic severity tokens\\n\\nAdditional: Added /validate plus other missing routes to daemon SPA fallback routes.\",\n40117-        \"supersedes\": null\n40118-      },\n40119-      {\n40120-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK0AAGNBZ9Z746GRS3V82CN6\",\n40121-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-06T00:56:21.931Z\",\n40122-        \"author\": 