0094-        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n40095-        \"content\": \"Implemented Validation and Alignment View at /validate route.\\n\\nApproach:\\n- Added fetchValidation() and fetchAlignment() API functions to api.ts with full TypeScript types mirroring daemon response shapes\\n- Built single-page component with three sections: summary cards (errors/warnings/overall status), alignment stats (spec coverage %, alignment %, orphaned specs, warnings), and issues list grouped by severity (errors > warnings > info)\\n- Issues are aggregated from both validation (schema errors, ref errors, trait cycles, completeness warnings, orphans) and alignment (status mismatches, orphaned specs, stale implementations) APIs\\n- Includes loading skeleton, error banner, empty state, and refresh button\\n- Static mode returns empty/valid defaults (read-only)\\n- Uses Svelte 5 runes exclusively (, , .by)\\n- Follows existing patterns from observations/dashboard pages\\n- Sidebar nav entry already existed at /validate with ShieldCheck icon\\n- All data-testid attributes for future E2E testing\\n\\nFiles changed:\\n- packages/web-ui/src/lib/api.ts — Added validation/alignment types and fetch functions\\n- packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte — Full page implementation\",\n40096-        \"supersedes\": null\n40097-      },\n40098-      {\n40099-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK0154ATGTMJR3XH21SPGTA8\",\n40100-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:16:08.282Z\",\n40101-        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n40102:        \"content\": \"Review findings: MUST-FIX 1) No test covers @ui-validation-view ac-1. The only AC annotations are in implementation files at packages/web-ui/src/lib/api.ts:808 and packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:2, and the branch changes no test files. 2) Spec mismatch in packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:60, 341-357, and 362-431: validItemCount is computed but never rendered, and the alignment section shows Alignment plus orphaned specs and warnings instead of the required AC coverage % and orphaned tasks/specs counts from @ui-validation-view ac-1. 3) Design-token gate failed in packages/web-ui/src/routes/validate/+page.svelte:235,240,263,314,329,345,383,399,449,455,479,485,509,515,540 because the page uses raw Tailwind colors like bg-red-50, text-yellow-600, bg-emerald-500, and bg-blue-50 instead of design tokens. Regression check passed: npm test and packages/web-ui npm test both exited 0.\",\n40103-        \"supersedes\": null\n40104-      },\n40105-      {\n40106-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK01561NNW942M40GXEP0A7V\",\n40107-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:16:10.037Z\",\n40108-        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n40109:        \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: Review issues: missing AC test coverage; validate view misses required valid item count / AC coverage / orphaned tasks data from @ui-validation-view ac-1; raw Tailwind colors used instead of design tokens.\",\n40110-        \"supersedes\": null\n40111-      },\n40112-      {\n40113-        \"_ulid\": \"01KK038AHY7KCNG2DQZQR9DEWD\",\n40114-        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T22:52:50.110Z\",\n40115-        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n40116:        \"content\": \"Fix cycle 1: Addressed all three MUST-FIX items from review.\\n\\n1. AC test coverage: Added 13 E2E tests (validate.spec.ts) covering summary cards, alignment section, issues list grouped by severity, loading/empty/error states, and navigation. All annotated with // AC: @ui-validation-view ac-1.\\n\\n2. Spec mismatch fixes:\\n   - Replaced 'Overall Status' card with 'Valid Items' card showing actual count (total items minus items with errors)\\n   - Replaced 'Alignment %' with 'AC Coverage %' (computed from missing_test_coverage completeness warnings)\\n   - Replaced 'Alignment Warnings' with 'Orphaned Tasks' (tasks without spec_ref)\\n   - Kept 'Orphaned Specs' (already correct)\\n\\n3. Design token gate:\\n   - Added severity tokens (error/warning/info/success) to 